<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! library.body.verifies ~ each body's bytes against the digest its directory names

`lares library verify [<collection>]` re-digests every body (one collection, or the whole shelf) and compares it with the cid its directory names. Any body that fails answers exit 1 with each failure named.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ whole-shelf · one-collection

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`whole-shelf` params=`~ verify every collection`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-collection` params=`collection/mark-twain ~ verify one collection`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ collection

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`collection` params=`takes/name seat/1 as/<collection> ~ one collection; absent, the whole shelf`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads this host's own library home; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`cure/[[library.body.verifies]] ~ a body's bytes digest otherwise than its directory names; each failure rides the answer`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ verified · failed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`verified` params=`exit/0 fields/[[checked failed verdicts]] ~ every body digests to the directory that holds it`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`failed` params=`exit/1 fields/[[checked failed verdicts]] ~ one or more bodies failed; verdicts names each`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares library verify

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares library verify]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

